// Multi-Tier Structural, API, ABI, Body & Codegen Fingerprints (`Fingerprint128`),
// Red-Green Change Propagation (`try_mark_green`), Private-Body Firewall,
// Cross-Module `const` / Generic / Inlined Body Dependency Tracking, and
// `inspect --emit=fingerprints` / `--emit=incremental-stats` (T757 / E18.2).
// Implements SPEC-22 §1-§2 & §4 (AXS-INC-001..013, AXS-INC-050..053, INV-INC-001).
